Workflow adaptation
-------------------
The adapted workflow analyzes the source ISO and boot metadata, extracts its
compressed live filesystem, edits a project root, regenerates squashfs and
filesystem metadata, and exports a bootable customized ISO with checksums.
The application shell, navigation, project model, jobs, diagnostics, recipes,
and cube-editor branding are Whitecube changes. The preserved Cubic source
provides an inspectable reference for the adaptation.

